# Materials Project API key for the scripts that query Materials Project (auto_mpquery.py, ecalj_auto).
# Copy this file to MaterialProject.key in the same directory (the top of ecalj) and replace the line below by your key:
#   cp MaterialProject.key.example MaterialProject.key; chmod 600 MaterialProject.key
# MaterialProject.key is ignored by git; never commit it. The environment variable MP_API_KEY takes precedence.
# Your key is on your dashboard at https://materialsproject.org
YourAPIkeyToMaterialProject
